## The Toes Deserve a Say Too

A pedicure this fall is not a decision you make for anyone watching. It's the one piece of the season that exists purely for you, tucked into boots most days and revealed only in the small, private moments that actually make up a life. Pick the shade that makes those moments feel good, not the one you think you're supposed to choose.

If chocolate brown or a deep merlot is calling your name, that instinct is worth trusting. Both have earned their place on this list for a reason. Book the appointment, or pull out the bottle at home, and let this season's version of you decide. For the rest of your fall nail refresh, <a href="/blog/fall/fall-nail-ideas">fall nail ideas</a> rounds out the full look from fingers to toes.
